      "message": ".data section is allocated after .bss, so looks like we cannot retrieve the size by SIZEOF(.data).\n\nSome experiments:\n \n1. If we use \". \u003d . + SIZEOF(.data);\" at ec.lds.S:279, and removes line . \u003d ALIGN(512);\n   we have\n\n   000074b4 A __ro_end   \n   000074b8 B __bss_start\n\n   the size (__bss_start - __ro_end) \u003d 4\n\n2. Use a trick \". \u003d . + (__data_end - __data_start);\" at ec.lds.S:279, and removes line . \u003d ALIGN(512);\n\n   we have\n\n   000074b4 A __ro_end         \n   000074e4 a __hey_flash_used \n   000074e4 A __image_size     \n   000074e8 B __bss_start      \n\n   the size (__bss_start - __ro_end) \u003d 52, which is what we need here.",
